{"type":"Film","id":"DE2016_122","slug":"de2016-122-wir-sind-juden-aus-breslau","title":{"native":"Wir sind Juden aus Breslau","english":"We Are Jews from Breslau"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-11-17","year":2016},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Karin Kaper","slug":"karin-kaper","name":"Karin Kaper","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},{"id":"Dirk Szuszies","slug":"dirk-szuszies","name":"Dirk Szuszies","birthYear":1956,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]}],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt6209590/mediaviewer/rm4095344896/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/video/vi2911944217/?playlistId=tt6209590&ref_=tt_ov_ov_vi"},"synopsis":{"native":"14 Zeitzeugen stehen im Mittelpunkt des Dokumentarfilms „Wir sind Juden aus Breslau“, die sich an vergangene Zeiten und die Schreckensherrschaft unter den Nazis erinnern. Als Kinder waren sie voller Erwartungen und in Breslau zuhause, in der Stadt, wo einst die drittgrößte jüdische Gemeinde Deutschlands beheimatet war. Doch als die Nationalsozialisten an die Macht kamen, einte die Heranwachsenden die Verfolgung und die ständige Furcht vor dem Tod. Einige gingen ins Exil, andere überlebten die Gräueltaten im Konzentrationslager von Auschwitz. Ob in den USA, England, Frankreich oder auch Deutschland, sie alle bauten sich später ein neues Leben auf und wirkten sogar an der Gründung des Staates Israel mit. Jahrzehnte später unternehmen sie nicht nur eine Reise zurück in die Heimat, sondern auch in die Vergangenheit und lassen eine deutsch-polnische Jugendgruppe an ihren Erfahrungen teilhaben.","english":"Peter Von Kant, a successful, famous director, lives with his assistant Karl, whom he likes to mistreat and humiliate. Through the great actress Sidonie, he meets and falls in love with Amir, a handsome young man of modest means. He offers to share his apartment and help Amir break into the world of cinema. Several months later, Amir becomes a star. But as soon as he acquires fame, he breaks up, leaving Peter alone to face himself."},"production":[{"country":"Germany","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Abraham Ascher","slug":"abraham-ascher","name":"Abraham Ascher","birthYear":1928,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"United States of America (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Anita Lasker-Wallfisch","slug":"anita-lasker-wallfisch","name":"Anita Lasker-Wallfisch","birthYear":1925,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland (the)","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Benjamin Sklarz","slug":"benjamin-sklarz","name":"Benjamin Sklarz","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Unknown","nationality":"Unknown","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"David Toren","slug":"david-toren","name":"David Toren","birthYear":1925,"deathYear":2020,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Dirk Szuszies","slug":"dirk-szuszies","name":"Dirk Szuszies","birthYear":1956,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Eli Heyman","slug":"eli-heyman","name":"Eli Heyman","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Unknown","nationality":"Unknown","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Esther Adler","slug":"esther-adler","name":"Esther Adler","birthYear":1924,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary subject"},{"person":{"id":"Fritz Stern","slug":"fritz-stern","name":"Fritz Stern","birthYear":1926,"deathYear":2016,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Germany","awards":[]},"role":"Documentary 